{
  "tema": 8749,
  "slug": "colores-genero-numero",
  "titulo": "Colors: gender and number",
  "subtitulo": "«Unas sandalias blancas y una tabla roja.»",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Colors are adjectives and agree with the noun: -o colors have four forms (rojo, roja, rojos, rojas); colors in -e or a consonant only change for number (verde, verdes; azul, azules). As nouns, colors are masculine: el rojo.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Colors go **after** the noun and agree with it."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Ending",
            "masc. sing.",
            "fem. sing.",
            "masc. pl.",
            "fem. pl."
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "-o",
              "negro",
              "negra",
              "negros",
              "negras"
            ],
            [
              "-e",
              "verde",
              "verde",
              "verdes",
              "verdes"
            ],
            [
              "consonant",
              "azul",
              "azul",
              "azules",
              "azules"
            ],
            [
              "-s",
              "gris",
              "gris",
              "grises",
              "grises"
            ],
            [
              "-é",
              "café",
              "café",
              "cafés",
              "cafés"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Naranja** and **rosa** don't change for gender: **un suéter naranja**, **una playera rosa**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The color itself (a noun) is masculine: **el rojo**, **el azul**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Tengo una tabla ==roja==.",
